# Enter the default dev shell (dotnet SDK) automatically on cd.
# The browser shell (chromium/node) stays opt-in: nix develop .#browser
#
# direnv without nix is fine too — you just install the SDK yourself (see README.md).
if has nix; then
  use flake
else
  log_status "nix not found; using system toolchain — install the .NET SDK per global.json (see README.md)"
fi
